Lab 9: Automating Host Registration with Boot ISO
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

• Create a boot ISO for Red Hat Satellite using Foreman • Configure automated host registration using discovery images • Use the boot ISO to automatically register systems with Satellite • Implement automated discovery and registration workflows for new systems • Troubleshoot common issues with automated host registration

Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

• Basic understanding of Linux system administration • Familiarity with Red Hat Satellite or Foreman concepts • Knowledge of virtualization and ISO mounting • Understanding of DHCP and PXE boot concepts • Access to command-line interface and text editors

Lab Environment
