Task 1: Create a Boot ISO for Satellite
Subtask 1.1: Access the Foreman Web Interface
Open your web browser and navigate to the Foreman server:
https://foreman.example.com
Log in with the provided credentials:

Username: admin
Password: admin123
Verify you can access the main dashboard and see the Foreman interface.

Subtask 1.2: Install Discovery Plugin
SSH into the Foreman server:
ssh root@foreman.example.com
Install the Foreman Discovery plugin:
foreman-installer --enable-foreman-plugin-discovery \
                  --enable-foreman-proxy-plugin-discovery
Restart the Foreman services:
systemctl restart httpd
systemctl restart foreman-proxy
Verify the plugin installation:
foreman-rake db:seed
Subtask 1.3: Configure Discovery Settings
In the Foreman web interface, navigate to Administer → Settings → Discovery.

Configure the following discovery settings:

discovery_fact: Set to discovery_bootif
discovery_auto: Set to true
discovery_hostname: Set to discovery
discovery_prefix: Set to mac
Click Submit to save the settings.

Subtask 1.4: Create Discovery Image
On the Foreman server, create a directory for the discovery image:
mkdir -p /var/lib/tftpboot/boot
cd /var/lib/tftpboot/boot
Download the Foreman Discovery image:
wget https://downloads.theforeman.org/discovery/releases/latest/fdi-image-latest.tar
Extract the discovery image:
tar -xf fdi-image-latest.tar
Create the boot ISO using the discovery image:
foreman-discovery-image \
  --output /tmp/discovery-boot.iso \
  --kernel /var/lib/tftpboot/boot/fdi-image/vmlinuz0 \
  --initrd /var/lib/tftpboot/boot/fdi-image/initrd0.img \
  --foreman-url https://foreman.example.com \
  --type iso
Subtask 1.5: Customize Boot ISO Parameters
Create a custom boot configuration file:
cat > /tmp/discovery-boot.cfg << 'EOF'
default discovery
label discovery
  kernel vmlinuz0
  append initrd=initrd0.img root=live:CDLABEL=FDIROOT rootfstype=auto ro rd.live.image acpi=force rd.luks=0 rd.md=0 rd.dm=0 rd.lvm=0 rd.bootif=0 rd.neednet=0 nomodeset proxy.url=https://foreman.example.com proxy.type=foreman
  ipappend 2
EOF
Generate the final boot ISO with custom parameters:
genisoimage -o /tmp/foreman-discovery.iso \
  -b isolinux/isolinux.bin \
  -c isolinux/boot.cat \
  -no-emul-boot \
  -boot-load-size 4 \
  -boot-info-table \
  -V "FDIROOT" \
  /var/lib/tftpboot/boot/fdi-image/
